# TEAM-12 · Health: an idle worker with no card is told to its leader after the minute asked.
start
see any key: close
key Escape
key /
type mend shelf.py
key Enter
key Escape Escape
see run .imece/worktree-setup.sh
key g d
key a
see run .imece/check on its
key g d
key a
see 1 ready to approve
type :health
key Enter
see health notices to the leader: stall 10m · idle 10m · loop 3
key a
see ALL DONE
type :health idle 1m
key Enter
key J
wait 100 has been idle 1 min with no card
